# All model calls go through OpenRouter with ONE key.
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys ; per-model rates at https://openrouter.ai/models
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<your-key>

# Agent model: YOUR choice (run_game.py refuses to guess). Either pass --models on the command
# line or set MODEL_NAME here. Measured through OpenRouter on 2026-09-15:
#   deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528   closest to the paper (full R1): 110-190 s per call, ~$0.01/call
#   qwen/qwen3-14b              hybrid reasoning model, thinks by default: 30-70 s per call, cheap tokens
#   openai/gpt-4.1-mini         non-reasoning, 1-2 s per call: best for iterating (--think for inspectable thoughts)
# MODEL_NAME=qwen/qwen3-14b

# Judge model (judges/api_judge.py) defaults to qwen/qwen3-14b, like the paper's Qwen judge.
# A 300-round duopoly = 600 calls; reasoning models also bill thinking tokens. Start with --rounds 30.
